{"id":"17369abed0ae21e6","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-decomposition.md","title":"Decomposition","display":"df-decomposition — Decomposition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-decomposition","aliases":["58-df-decomposition"],"display":"df-decomposition — Decomposition","depends_on":["[[58-df-partition]]","[[58-df-set]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-decomposition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-decomposition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-decomposition — Decomposition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ebc39f41721b42e4\" href=\"?note=ebc39f41721b42e4\" title=\"58-df-partition\">58-df-partition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (object)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:I\\to\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(s:I\\to\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (set-coded component family)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decomposition}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Decomposition}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (decomposition predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decomposition} \\vdash \\mathrm{Decomposition}_S(X,I,s)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(s,I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}s(i)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(s(i)\\neq\\emptyset)\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\bigl(i\\neq j\\to s(i)\\cap s(j)=\\emptyset\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decomposition} \\vdash \\mathrm{Decomposition}_S(X,I,s)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(s,I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}s(i)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(s(i)\\neq\\emptyset)\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\bigl(i\\neq j\\to s(i)\\cap s(j)=\\emptyset\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is exactly a set-coded partition of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> indexed by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>; empty components are excluded.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-partition","status":"resolved","id":"ebc39f41721b42e4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-partition]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"s:I\\to\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Decomposition}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decomposition} \\vdash \\mathrm{Decomposition}_S(X,I,s)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(s,I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}s(i)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(s(i)\\neq\\emptyset)\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\bigl(i\\neq j\\to s(i)\\cap s(j)=\\emptyset\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false}],"bytes":830,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-396","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-decomposition.md|58-df-decomposition]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["ebc39f41721b42e4","65d9a1e690c32aad","36d7463d215be751"]}